{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>And he put out a hand.</b> One of them, though his name is not mentioned, for he had not yet been named. Also this one, by a wondrous act, for the placentas were joined together, and this one drew back his hand, and his brother came out."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:26.361511159Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}